<Base title="About CupToGram | Ingredient Conversion Tools" description="Learn why CupToGram provides ingredient-specific kitchen measurement estimates." path="/about/"><main class="wrap content"><h1>About CupToGram</h1><p>CupToGram helps home cooks and bakers convert common ingredient measurements between volume and weight. The goal is to make everyday recipe preparation clearer with quick estimates, practical measurement notes, and simple kitchen tools.</p><h2>Designed for practical use</h2><p>A cup is a volume measurement, while a gram is a weight measurement. Different ingredients have different densities, so one universal cup-to-gram number would be misleading. We show ingredient-specific reference values and explain where variation can occur.</p></main></Base>